<section class="case-section">
  <div class="case-section__head"><span class="mono" data-reveal>Build</span><h2 class="display-s" data-split>A pure, seeded rules engine — and everything on top of it.</h2></div>
  <div class="case-section__body prose" data-reveal>
    <p>The game runs on a deterministic, seeded rules engine: every run is replayable from its seed, every rule is testable in isolation, and the same engine powers the browser client, the simulation harness and the print export. On top of it sits a 66-card content set with painted art, a complete free-to-play client with a between-runs metagame — quests, an armoury, a battle pass, accounts and cloud saves, a store — and a print-ready pipeline for the boxed edition.</p>
    <p>I directed the art, wrote the chapters, tuned the economy, built the client, and shipped the marketing site.</p>
  </div>
</section>

